Z||000005||kempo||11-29-2001||04:08 PM||||The radio could also be the culpret here.  If it has a bad ground, a whole number of things could and will happen.  The unit could have also gone bad.  With a bad unit, or bad connection, the radio could be the source of your problems.  Try removing the radio and see if you still experience the other problems mentioned.||||reg||1
