Z||000009||Mach10||11-29-2001||06:50 PM||||It's a short... When the doors open, something grounds, and dim the lights. At the same time, the radio loses the required current to keep memory.<P>Check the wiring from the door-switches back. It's on THAT circuit  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
